% Things that are not scarce (ideas, patterns) are never owned.
thf(nonrivalrous_unowned, axiom,
    ![O:en,T:tm]: (~ rivalrous(O) => unowned(O,T))).
% LEMMA (proved in its own problem): Anyone may use an unowned thing.
